  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Hello, Beloved Affiliates! 🌿</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">💚 We're looking to partner with radiant individuals who embrace a holistic lifestyle, care about clean beauty, practice a loving relationship with nature, and have a deep appreciate for handcrafted, organic, and locally-made goods.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We are EarthTonics Botanical Skincare, where our sole purpose is to inspire radical self-love and help you attain, and maintain, your best skin ever. All of our products are handcrafted from organic, wild, fair trade, and sustainable ingredients, made locally in our Ojai apothecary.&nbsp; (Shop small business! Shop female owned!)</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">EarthTonics was born when our founder, a holistic esthitician, was determined to heal her breakout-prone skin without harsh detergents or artificial ingredients. 16 years later, we've gathered the most exquisite, nutrient-dense botanicals from Earth&rsquo;s purest sources to handcraft our signature plant-powered skincare.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">To read more about our brand, click <a href=\"earthtonicsskincare.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>💚 Affiliate Details! 💚</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Post your unique affiliate link wherever promoting our product, and earn 20% on all sales you generate! Payouts occur regularly on a weekly basis.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">WHAT WE LOVE: Sincere product reviews, GRWM, before and afters, anything that shows your beautiful face!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Looking forward to sharing the Glow together!</p>\r\n</div>",
